<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2026-04-13T07:44:28+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Mon, 13 Apr 2026 07:44:28 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title><![CDATA["Sorry not sorry": Internet meltdown intensifies as Sykkuno fake apology post spreads during ongoing controversy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130222413.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Sykkuno went viral after a fake “sorry not sorry” Instagram screenshot spread online, leading many to believe he had responded to serious allegations. The post was later proven fabricated, but the damage was done as fans reacted strongly. With no official statement from him, speculation continues to grow, highlighting how quickly misinformation spreads when audiences are searching for answers during ongoing controversy.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/sorry-not-sorry-internet-meltdown-intensifies-as-sykkuno-fake-apology-post-spreads-during-ongoing-controversy/articleshow/130222413.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us-streamers/sorry-not-sorry-internet-meltdown-intensifies-as-sykkuno-fake-apology-post-spreads-during-ongoing-controversy/articleshow/130222413.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-13T05:46:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Barsha Dutta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130222413,imgsize-43650.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US blocks 'all maritime traffic' to Iran ports after Islamabad talks fail, allows Hormuz passage]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130222282.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The US military will blockade all Iranian Gulf ports starting Monday at 1400 GMT, while allowing non-Iranian bound vessels to transit the Strait of Hormuz. This action follows failed talks with Tehran over its nuclear ambitions, with President Trump accusing Iran of backtracking on assurances and engaging in "WORLD EXTORTION."]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/us-blocks-all-maritime-traffic-to-iran-ports-after-talks-fail-allows-hormuz-passage/articleshow/130222282.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/us-blocks-all-maritime-traffic-to-iran-ports-after-talks-fail-allows-hormuz-passage/articleshow/130222282.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-13T04:45:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130222288,imgsize-865698.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Hate crimes targeting Sikh Americans in US rose 3,700% in a decade: FBI report]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3