um-to-turkey/articleshow/130206552.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/1bn-a-bride-or-a-breakup-uganda-generals-bizarre-ultimatum-to-turkey/articleshow/130206552.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-12T16:26:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130206564,imgsize-826631.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Russia-Ukraine war: Thousands of violations reported as brief Easter truce breaks down]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130206009.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/russia-ukraine-war-thousands-of-violations-reported-as-brief-easter-truce-breaks-down/articleshow/130206009.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/russia-ukraine-war-thousands-of-violations-reported-as-brief-easter-truce-breaks-down/articleshow/130206009.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-12T15:46:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130206013,imgsize-1012921.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Saudi Arabia launches 5 rail routes to cut cargo time and costs, linking Gulf ports faster]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130203745.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Saudi Arabia has launched five new rail logistics routes to accelerate cargo movement and reduce transport costs, connecting Gulf ports with key economic hubs. This initiative aims to enhance supply chain efficiency, ease highway congestion, and position the Kingdom as a vital link in global trade under Vision 2030.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/saudi-arabia-launches-5-rail-routes-to-cut-cargo-time-and-costs-linking-gulf-ports-faster/articleshow/130203745.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/saudi-arabia-launches-5-rail-routes-to-cut-cargo-time-and-costs-linking-gulf-ports-faster/articleshow/130203745.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-12T12:30:22+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130203971,imgsize-110108.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[China to resume flights, ease trade curbs with Taiwan amid outreach push]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/130202645.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[China is set to resume direct flights to more Taiwanese cities. Imports of Taiwanese aquaculture products will also restart. These moves follow talks between Chinese and Taiwanese leaders. Beijing aims to establish a communication mechanism with Taiwan's Kuomintang party. Trade restrictions are being eased. Infrastructure proposals are also being advanced.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/china-to-resume-flights-ease-trade-curbs-with-taiwan-amid-outreach-push/articleshow/130202645.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/china-to-resume-flights-ease-trade-curbs-with-taiwan-amid-outreach-push/articleshow/130202645.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-04-12T11:58:16+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-130203664,imgsize-1185693.cms"/></item></channel></rss>